            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.9.14+MAT.9.15+MAT.9.16+MAT.9.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 9:14-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.5.33+LUK.5.34+LUK.5.35+LUK.5.36+LUK.5.37+LUK.5.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 5:33-38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ abigishwa ba Yohana bo n’Abafarisayo bāri bisonzesheje. Baraza, baramubaza, bati N’iki gituma abigishwa ba Yohana n’abigishwa b’Abafarisayo bisonzesha, abigishwa bawe ntibisonzeshe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu arababaza, ati Mbeg’ abātowe bokwisonzesha bate, bakiri kumwe n’umukwe? Umukwe akiri kumwe na bo ntibashobora kwisonzesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Har’ imisi izoza, umukwe akūrwe muri bo, bazoca bisonzesha uwo musi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nta wobarīra ikiremo c’igitambara gisha ku mpuzu y’umushire; kukw ico kiremo coyitabura, igisha kikavana n’umushire, ikarushiriza gutabuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nta wotara umutobe wa vino mu mikuza y’insato ibōmbōtse; kuko vino yoturitsa iyo mikuza, vino n’imikuza bigapfana. Arik’ umutobe wa vino bawutara mu mikuza misha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
